</div> <div class="mntl-author-tooltip__bio">
<p>Lauren is an award-winning registered dietitian, author of three books and all-around lover of good food. After graduating with a bachelor&#39;s degree in food science and human nutrition and a master&#39;s degree in clinical nutrition, Lauren has worked in various nutrition-related settings, most currently writing nutrition-related content for online outlets including Verywell Health, PopSugar, The Kitchn, and EatingWell. Additionally, she manages the Instagram page &#64;LaurenLovesNutrition, where people can receive evidence-based nutrition tips and updates.</p>
